{"s":86,"v":[{"t":"By the sky and the night comer","w":[["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","By the sky","wal-samāi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["وَٱلطَّارِقِ","and the night comer","wal-ṭāriqi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["طَّارِقِ",2474]]]]},{"t":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","w":[["وَمَآ","And what","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَآ",12]]],["أَدْرَىٰكَ","can make you know","adrāka","",[["أَدْرَىٰ",558],["كَ",18]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["ٱلطَّارِقُ","the night comer (is)","l-ṭāriqu","",[["ٱل",2],["طَّارِقُ",2474]]]]},{"t":"It is the piercing star","w":[["ٱلنَّجْمُ","(It is) the star","al-najmu","",[["ٱل",2],["نَّجْمُ",696]]],["ٱلثَّاقِبُ","the piercing","l-thāqibu","",[["ٱل",2],["ثَّاقِبُ",2284]]]]},{"t":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","w":[["إِن","Not","in",""],["كُلُّ","(is) every","kullu",""],["نَفْسٍۢ","soul","nafsin",""],["لَّمَّا","but","lammā",""],["عَلَيْهَا","over it","ʿalayhā","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هَا",22]]],["حَافِظٌۭ","(is) a protector","ḥāfiẓun",""]]},{"t":"So let man observe from what he was created.","w":[["فَلْيَنظُرِ","So let see","falyanẓuri","",[["فَ",7],["لْ",0],["يَنظُرِ",144]]],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","man","l-insānu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنُ",181]]],["مِمَّ","from what","mimma","",[["مِ",6],["مَّ",12]]],["خُلِقَ","he is created","khuliqa",""]]},{"t":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","w":[["خُلِقَ","He is created","khuliqa",""],["مِن","from","min",""],["مَّآءٍۢ","a water","māin",""],["دَافِقٍۢ","ejected","dāfiqin",""]]},{"t":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","w":[["يَخْرُجُ","Coming forth","yakhruju",""],["مِنۢ","from","min",""],["بَيْنِ","between","bayni",""],["ٱلصُّلْبِ","the backbone","l-ṣul'bi","",[["ٱل",2],["صُّلْبِ",2463]]],["وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","and the ribs","wal-tarāibi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["تَّرَآئِبِ",3163]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, He","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["رَجْعِهِۦ","return him","rajʿihi","",[["رَجْعِ",1843],["هِۦ",5]]],["لَقَادِرٌۭ","(is) Able","laqādirun","",[["لَ",23],["قَادِرٌۭ",658]]]]},{"t":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","w":[["يَوْمَ","(The) Day","yawma",""],["تُبْلَى","will be tested","tub'lā",""],["ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","the secrets","l-sarāiru","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّرَآئِرُ",3642]]]]},{"t":"Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.","w":[["فَمَا","Then not","famā","",[["فَ",7],["مَا",12]]],["لَهُۥ","(is) for him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["مِن","any","min",""],["قُوَّةٍۢ","power","quwwatin",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["نَاصِرٍۢ","any helper","nāṣirin",""]]},{"t":"By the sky which sends back","w":[["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","By the sky","wal-samāi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءِ",49]]],["ذَاتِ","which","dhāti",""],["ٱلرَّجْعِ","returns","l-rajʿi","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّجْعِ",1843]]]]},{"t":"And [by] the earth which splits,","w":[["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","And the earth","wal-arḍi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["ذَاتِ","which","dhāti",""],["ٱلصَّدْعِ","cracks open","l-ṣadʿi","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّدْعِ",3753]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed, it","innahu","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُۥ",5]]],["لَقَوْلٌۭ","(is) surely a Word","laqawlun","",[["لَ",23],["قَوْلٌۭ",137]]],["فَصْلٌۭ","decisive","faṣlun",""]]},{"t":"And it is not amusement.","w":[["وَمَا","And not","wamā","",[["وَ",1],["مَا",12]]],["هُوَ","it","huwa",""],["بِٱلْهَزْلِ","(is) for amusement","bil-hazli","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["هَزْلِ",4592]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","w":[["إِنَّهُمْ","Indeed, they","innahum","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَكِيدُونَ","are plotting","yakīdūna","",[["يَكِيدُ",995],["ونَ",3]]],["كَيْدًۭا","a plot","kaydan",""]]},{"t":"But I am planning a plan.","w":[["وَأَكِيدُ","But I am planning","wa-akīdu","",[["وَ",1],["أَكِيدُ",995]]],["كَيْدًۭا","a plan","kaydan",""]]},{"t":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","w":[["